From: "qwen.ai[bot]" <qwenlm-intl@service.alibaba.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 19:33:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/25] Fix PDF export layout and correct Cauchy limit logic in
 prompts/OCR

- src/processing/text_cleaner.py: New module for OCR noise correction; regexes fix false set-minus ($X \setminus O$) to punctured neighborhood ($\dot{O}$), normalize variants, and wrap bare math Unicode chars into LaTeX.
- src/llm/prompt_builder.py: Added strict mathematical rules forbidding $X \setminus O(x_0)$ in favor of $\dot{O}(x_0)$; integrated text_cleaner into `normalize_ocr_case` for RAG context preprocessing.
- src/processing/exporter.py: Refactored PDF generation to use inline tokenization; math symbols/formulas rendered as 300-dpi PNG images via latex_renderer/mathtext to prevent vertical layout breakage; rewrote Markdown table renderer with fixed column widths and embedded image cells.
- src/processing/text_corrector.py: Integrated `text_cleaner` pipeline before heuristic TOC corrections to ensure mathematical semantics are preserved during OCR post-processing.
